title: "HBD Root-Finder: Horner¨CBinary Deflation for Polynomial Root Finding"
abstract: "HBD (Horner¨CBinary Deflation Root-Finder) is an algorithm for finding all roots of a univariate polynomial by combining Horner's nested evaluation scheme with a binary-synchronous deflation strategy."
